[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3540.069, "timestamp": "00:59:00", "text": "我的天啊。最后，我被迫停止了行动。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3546.47, "timestamp": "00:59:06", "text": "嗯，厕所那招可能不管用。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3550.22, "timestamp": "00:59:10", "text": "彩色款仍然有效，但其他款仍然有效。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3552.39, "timestamp": "00:59:12", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3555.43, "timestamp": "00:59:15", "text": "嘿，他们新增了一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3558.309, "timestamp": "00:59:18", "text": "所以你现在就像长了翅膀一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3560.549, "timestamp": "00:59:20", "text": "你可以像……一样飞翔"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3562.39, "timestamp": "00:59:22", "text": "等等，真的吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3565.109, "timestamp": "00:59:25", "text": "是的。你想试试吗？是的。是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3567.91, "timestamp": "00:59:27", "text": "我很乐意。好的。然后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3570.17, "timestamp": "00:59:30", "text": "联系它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3577.51, "timestamp": "00:59:37", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3579.51, "timestamp": "00:59:39", "text": "哦，你也想要一些耐力吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3589.589, "timestamp": "00:59:49", "text": "哦，耐力"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3592.63, "timestamp": "00:59:52", "text": "会很便宜，但我认为我们出去了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3594.789, "timestamp": "00:59:54", "text": "哦。哦，如果你……，你可以提升耐力。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3596.63, "timestamp": "00:59:56", "text": "想。"}]